                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "stellar puzzle game.\n\nbasically, you need to construct a circuit-like path for the ball and claim all the blue squares on the boards.\n\npros:\n____\n\n- more than 170 puzzles for so little money\n- devilishly brilliant puzzle design\n- many mechanics introduced at a good pace\n- minimalist and clean design that still has character and personality\n- non irritating music that you can swtich on and off on the fly\n\ncons:\n____\n\n- the panel moves as you move the mouse around. i personally got used to it because the puzzles are just too good, but this might not sit well with many users\n- i would have loved if the tiles you can move around are stacked in a side panel rather than on the puzzle board itself. it would have helped with imagining the route more easily.\n\noverall i definitely recommend this game to any puzzle fan.\n\n- EDIT - i contacted the dev @KirUn regarding a puzzle i was stuck with and he very kindly reached out to me. i take these things very seriously, and the fact that he did respond to me shows he cares for his gamers. i hope the best for him and for this little gem of a game. hopefully more to come!",
